# Kamidori furigana (op 0x196). The prologue page at SC0000@0xfa2 shows 叛乱 with the ruby はんらん: 8 px MS Gothic
# over the base word, drawn by SYS4433's rule (adv_text_draw_ruby_over_row_sys4433@0x4590d0; docs/engine-re.md,
# "Furigana"). History redraws the ruby over the same word. Compare the kamidori-furigana-* shots between targets.
# The English fan translation blanks every ruby, so run on the clean install (Kamidori/), as both targets do by
# default. On a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --profile kamidori port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --profile kamidori port run tools/drive/scenarios/kamidori-furigana.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 4
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=30
wait 3
click newgame.begin
wait-state script=SC0000 timeout=60
wait-state at=SC0000@0xfa2 click=adv.next every=2.5 timeout=180   # １８年前、叛乱によって王政が崩壊すると、…
wait 3
move 512 288
wait 1
shot kamidori-furigana-page

wheel up 1
wait-state script=HISTORY timeout=10
wait 3
shot kamidori-furigana-history
